senses.gloss:
विशसनम् + .{@-नः@}
—1 A sabre, crooked sword.
—2 A sword in general.

विशाल + .{@-लः@}
—1 A kind of deer.
—2 A kind of bird.

विशिख + .{@-खः@}
—1 An arrow; माधव मनसिजविशिखभयादिव भावनया त्वयि लीना Gīt. 4;
 R. 5. 50; Mv. 2. 38.
—2 A kind of reed.
—3 An iron crow.
—4 (In Math.) A versed sine.

विशेषक + .{@-कः, -कम्@}
—1 A distinguishing feature or characteristic, an attribute.
—2 A discriminative or distinguishing quality.
—3 A mark on the forehead with sandal, saffron &c.
—4 Drawing lines of painting on the face and person with coloured unguents
 and cosmetics; प्रत्याख्यातविशेषकं कुरबकं श्यामावदातारुणम् M. 3. 5;
 स्वेदोद्गमः किंपुरुषाङ्गनानां चक्रे पदं पत्रविशेषकेषु Ku. 3. 33;
 R. 9. 29; Śi. 3. 63, 10. 84.

विशेषक + .{@-कः, -कम्@}
